## Naming Patterns

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| CLI script | `{action}_{target}.py` | `evaluate_loupe_annotations.py`, `run_morans_i.py` |
| Plot helper | `plot_{what}()` | `plot_celltype_overlay()`, `plot_enrichment_heatmap()` |
| Analysis helper | `{verb}_{noun}()` | `analyze_sample()`, `build_celltype_color_map()` |
| Snakemake rule | `{verb}_{noun}` | `preprocess_spatial`, `run_morans_i` |
| Output figures | `spatial_{label}_{desc}.png` | `spatial_qc_Tuyu_..._016um.png` |
| Loupe exports | `spatial_{label}_for_loupe.csv` | under `for_loupe/` |
| Sample label | `{cohort}_{sample_id}_{bin_size}` | `Tuyu_Apr2026_846531_..._016um` |

Metadata columns — preserve existing names and prefixes:
- `tlcelltype_assigned`, `nnls_celltype_assigned`, `predicted.id`, `cellestimate`
- Prefixes: `tlscore_`, `nnls_`, `norm_`

